    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84870" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-θηρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with much game, full of
				wild beasts,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					801
				</span></i>
			 (lyr., 
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>mighty huntress,</i> epith. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δίκτυννα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				145
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>taking many fish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				5.18
			</span></i>.</div>
